# Planned-website prototypes drop here.
#
# Drop HTML mockups in this folder. Each file is served at /plan/<filename>.html
# from the deployed site (Vercel preserves files under public/ as static).
#
# After dropping a file:
#   1. Add an entry to src/content/planned-projects.json describing it
#      (title, description, file path, optional thumbnail, optional tags).
#   2. Card grid at /planned-website auto-picks it up — no code change needed.
#
# *.html files in this folder are tracked. Do not commit large binary attachments.
